{"suttaId":"tha-ap61","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4159,4192],"vripara":"67"},"segments":{"tha-ap61:0.3":"Padumattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap61:1.1":"“Catusaccaṃ pakāsento, varadhammappavattako;","tha-ap61:1.3":"Vassate [vasseti (?)] amataṃ vuṭṭhiṃ, nibbāpento mahājanaṃ.","tha-ap61:2.1":"“Sadhajaṃ [sadaṇḍaṃ (sī.)] padumaṃ gayha, aḍḍhakose ṭhito ahaṃ;","tha-ap61:2.3":"Padumuttaramunissa, pahaṭṭho ukkhipimambare.","tha-ap61:3.1":"“Āgacchante ca padume, abbhuto āsi tāvade;","tha-ap61:3.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, paggaṇhi vadataṃ varo.","tha-ap61:4.1":"“Karaseṭṭhena paggayha, jalajaṃ pupphamuttamaṃ;","tha-ap61:4.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe ṭhito satthā, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap61:5.1":"“‘Yenidaṃ padumaṃ khittaṃ, sabbaññumhi vināyake [sabbaññutamanāyake (syā. ka.)];","tha-ap61:5.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato.","tha-ap61:6.1":"“‘Tiṃsakappāni devindo, devarajjaṃ karissati;","tha-ap61:6.3":"Pathabyā rajjaṃ sattasataṃ, vasudhaṃ āvasissati.","tha-ap61:7.1":"“‘Tattha pattaṃ gaṇetvāna, cakkavattī bhavissati;","tha-ap61:7.3":"Ākāsato pupphavuṭṭhi, abhivassissatī tadā.","tha-ap61:8.1":"“‘Kappasatasahassamhi, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap61:8.3":"Gotamo nāma nāmena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap61:9.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap61:9.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, nibbāyissatināsavo’.","tha-ap61:10.1":"“Nikkhamitvāna kucchimhā, sampajāno patissato;","tha-ap61:10.3":"Jātiyā pañcavassohaṃ, arahattaṃ apāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap61:11.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap61:12.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā padumo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap61:13.1":"Padumattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2594,"to":2595,"paras":[{"para":2594,"vripara":"67","refs":["tha-ap61:1"],"lines":["Attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>catusaccaṃ pakāsento</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>saccan</b>ti tathaṃ avitathaṃ aviparītaṃ saccaṃ, dukkhasamudayanirodhamaggavasena cattāri saccāni samāhaṭānīti catusaccaṃ, taṃ catusaccaṃ pakāsento loke pākaṭaṃ karontoti attho.","<b>Varadhammappavattako</b>ti uttamadhammappavattako pakāsakoti attho.","<b>Amataṃ vuṭṭhin</b>ti amatamahānibbānavuṭṭhidhāraṃ pavassanto paggharanto sadevakaṃ lokaṃ temento sabbakilesapariḷāhaṃ nibbāpento dhammavassaṃ vassatīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap61:1"],["tha-ap61:1"],["tha-ap61:1"],["tha-ap61:1"]]},{"para":2595,"vripara":"68","refs":["tha-ap61:2"],"lines":["<b>Sadhajaṃ padumaṃ gayhā</b>ti dhajena saha ekato katvā padumaṃ padumakalāpaṃ gahetvāti attho.","<b>Aḍḍhakose ṭhito ahan</b>ti ubho ukkhipitvā ṭhito ahanti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap61:2"],["tha-ap61:2"],["tha-ap61:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap61:1.1","catusaccaṃ pakāsento",0,0],["tha-ap61:1.1","saccaṃ",0,1],["tha-ap61:1.1","varadhammappavattako",0,2],["tha-ap61:1.3","amataṃ vuṭṭhiṃ",0,3],["tha-ap61:2.1","sadhajaṃ padumaṃ gayhā",1,0],["tha-ap61:2.1","aḍḍhakose ṭhito ahaṃ",1,1]]},"tika":null}
